    {"id":"OFFER","layer":"Trade","purpose":"عرض تجاري ناتج عن مطابقة","status":"DRAFT|SENT|ACCEPTED|REJECTED|EXPIRED|WITHDRAWN","fields":["id:uuid PK","match_id:uuid FK","issuer_id:uuid FK","terms:jsonb","valid_until:date"],"audit":"send/accept/reject"},
    {"id":"NEGOTIATION","layer":"Trade","purpose":"سجل تفاوض مضبوط بين أطراف العلاقة","status":"OPEN|PENDING_RESPONSE|AGREED|ABANDONED","fields":["id:uuid PK","offer_id:uuid FK","participants:jsonb","version:int"],"audit":"messages and term changes"},
