    {"id":"NOTIFICATION","layer":"Support","purpose":"تنبيه قابل للتتبع لحالة أو حدث حساس","status":"UNREAD|READ|ACKNOWLEDGED|DISMISSED","fields":["id:uuid PK","recipient_id:uuid FK","event_type:string","severity:enum"],"audit":"delivery/read/acknowledge"}
  ],
  "relationships": [
    {"from":"PERSON","to":"USER_ACCOUNT","cardinality":"1:1","optional":"required","meaning":"person owns one account"},
    {"from":"PERSON","to":"KYC_RECORD","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"required for verification","meaning":"person may have verification attempts"},
    {"from":"KYC_RECORD","to":"VERIFIED_IDENTITY","cardinality":"1:0..1","optional":"optional until verified","meaning":"verified identity is projection of successful KYC"},
    {"from":"PERSON","to":"BUSINESS_MEMBERSHIP","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"one person may represent multiple entities"},
    {"from":"BUSINESS_ENTITY","to":"KYB_RECORD","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"required for commercial access","meaning":"entity verification history"},
    {"from":"BUSINESS_ENTITY","to":"BUSINESS_MEMBERSHIP","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"entity has authorized members"},
    {"from":"PERSON","to":"INDIVIDUAL_ACTIVITY_PROFILE","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"verified person can declare a consumer or individual producer capability"},
    {"from":"BUSINESS_ENTITY","to":"BUSINESS_ACTIVITY_VERIFICATION","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"required for operational trade source","meaning":"KYB-verified entity requires a separately verified commercial activity"},
    {"from":"BUSINESS_ENTITY|INDIVIDUAL_ACTIVITY_PROFILE","to":"TRADE_OFFERING|TRADE_DEMAND","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"exactly one source","meaning":"a trade object has one verified individual or business source, never both"},
    {"from":"BUSINESS_MEMBERSHIP","to":"ROLE","cardinality":"N:1","optional":"required","meaning":"membership receives role"},
    {"from":"ROLE","to":"PERMISSION","cardinality":"N:M","optional":"required","meaning":"role grants permission through ROLE_PERMISSION"},
    {"from":"BUSINESS_ENTITY","to":"PRODUCT|SERVICE|USED_ASSET","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"entity owns or provides offerings"},
    {"from":"DEMAND","to":"MATCH","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"demand generates candidates"},
    {"from":"MATCH","to":"OFFER","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"eligible match may produce offers"},
    {"from":"OFFER","to":"NEGOTIATION","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"offer may be negotiated"},
    {"from":"CONTRACT","to":"ORDER","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"contract governs execution"},
    {"from":"ORDER","to":"TRANSACTION","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"order produces transaction records"},
    {"from":"CONTRACT|TRANSACTION","to":"DISPUTE","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"commercial event may be disputed"},
    {"from":"DISPUTE","to":"EVIDENCE","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"optional","meaning":"dispute contains evidence"},
    {"from":"PERSON|BUSINESS_ENTITY|GOVERNMENT_ENTITY","to":"AUDIT_LOG","cardinality":"1:N","optional":"required for sensitive actions","meaning":"actors and subjects are audited"}
  ],
